resume-from-issue/design.md","title":"D9: marker spoofing 分析が正確","rationale":"identity 3 照合（state.jobId / state.issueNumber / state.branch）により、偽 marker の jobId は Development リンク上に一致 checkpoint を持てず fail-closed になることを論理的に確認。author gating 不要という判断が正当。"},{"severity":"low","file":"specrunner/changes/issue-target-resume-from-issue/design.md","title":"CWD ratchet への影響なし（既存エントリでカバー）","rationale":"arch-allowlist.ts の CWD-registry-generate-resume-attach-archive-debt エントリ（pattern: cwd: process.cwd(),）が command-registry.ts での --from-issue routing をカバー済み。新エントリ追加不要という D7 の主張が正確。"}]},"followUpAttempts":0,"transientRetryAttempts":0,"addedTurns":{"reportRetry":0,"postWork":0,"outputRepair":0}},"startedAt":"2026-08-20T09:46:44.796Z","endedAt":"2026-08-20T09:55:20.806Z","commitOid":"82ea7b16065f294f7ff1e8fdc7b8f29f0e52efbc"}
